{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":13},"Tout s'est bien passé (Everything Went Fine)","Emmanuèle, romancière épanouie dans sa vie privée et professionnelle, se précipite à l’hôpital, son père André vient de faire un AVC. Fantasque, aimant passionnément la vie mais diminué, il demande à sa fille de l’aider à en finir. Avec l’aide de sa sœur Pascale, elle va devoir choisir : accepter la volonté de son père ou le convaincre de changer d’avis. (When André, 85, has a stroke, Emmanuèle hurries to her father’s bedside. Sick and half-paralyzed in his hospital bed, he asks Emmanuèle to help him end his life. But how can you honor such a request when it’s your own father?)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"parenthood","suicide","physical illness","lgbtqi","hospital","cultural memory","agony","may-december","medical treatment",{"type":14,"id":15,"slug":16,"title":17,"release":20,"filmType":24,"directors":25,"genre":48,"media":50,"synopsis":53,"production":56,"characters":59,"roles":87,"awards":148,"tags":3},"Film","FR2021_072","fr2021-072-tout-s-est-bien-passe",{"native":18,"english":19},"Tout s'est bien passé","Everything Went Fine",{"type":21,"date":22,"year":23},"Theatrical release","2021-09-22",2021,"Fiction film",[26],{"id":27,"slug":28,"name":27,"birthYear":29,"deathYear":30,"gender":31,"nationality":32,"awards":33},"François Ozon","francois-ozon",1967,0,"Male identifying","France",[34,42],{"film":35,"year":23,"award":39,"category":40,"result":41},{"slug":36,"title":37},"fr2020-045-ete-85",{"native":38},"Été 85","César du cinéma","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":43,"year":47,"award":39,"category":40,"result":41},{"slug":44,"title":45},"fr2019-036-grace-a-dieu",{"native":46},"Grâce à Dieu",2020,[49],"Drama",{"posterUrl":51,"trailerUrl":52},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/24/160/237592/format_page/everything-went-fine.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zgBkLyB2MB4",{"native":54,"english":55},"Emmanuèle, romancière é